    <bpmn:dataObjectReference id="DataObjectReference_1yaar54" name="Rules for eligibility: 1. No Pre-Existing Hardship or Vulnerability Flags. Detail: The customer has no recorded health, mental vulnerability, or severe financial distress flags in the core database. 2. No Active Account Dispute. Detail: The overdue balance, fees, or underlying contract are not currently under legal appeal or formal customer dispute 3. Overdue Balance Within Policy Threshold. Rule: Overdue balance &#60; £5,000. Detail: High-value debts above the threshold require manual underwriter or representative sign-off. 4. Early-Stage Delinquency Age: Rule: Days Overdue &#60; 60days. Detail: Accounts in early delinquency respond well to automated self-service; late-stage debt requires specialist collection strategies." dataObjectRef="DataObject_081a2m7" />
    <bpmn:dataObject id="DataObject_081a2m7" />
